      {
        "id": 0,
        "original_id": "ecf3fa4b-b857-53f6-9e51-534f7b062a89",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Chinese Chongqing Dog, Kanni, Tugou, Chinese Field Dog, Xiasi Dog\n- Places: China, Tamil Nadu, Tianjin, Nankai District, Huayuan Area\n- Concepts: dog breeds, hunting, coursing, protection, population\n\nFacts:\n- The Chinese Chongqing Dog was used in its early years for hunting wild boar and rabbits.\n- The Chinese Chongqing Dog is now used in China to protect families and belongings.\n- The Kanni is a rare indigenous South Indian sighthound breed of dog found in Tamil Nadu.\n- The name Kanni means maiden.\n- The Kanni breed is used mainly for coursing game.\n- Tugou includes the Chinese Field Dog, the Chinese Chongqing Dog, the Xiasi Dog, and several other native dog breeds distributed across China.\n- Huayuan Area is a town of Nankai District in Tianjin, China.\n- Huayuan Area has a population of 70,000.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
        "id": 1,
        "original_id": "2eae05ad-a633-5503-9a11-bae0b3dcaab5",
        "text": "Page: Chinese Chongqing Dog. Sentence: In its early years, it was used for hunting wild boar and rabbits, but it's now used in China to protect families and belongings.\nPage: Kanni. Sentence: The Kanni, which means maiden, is a rare indigenous South Indian sighthound breed of dog found in the state of Tamil Nadu.\nPage: Kanni. Sentence: The breed is used mainly for coursing game.\nPage: Tugou. Sentence: Tugou includes the most popular Chinese dog breed - the Chinese Field Dog (, pinyin: \"zhōng huá tián yuán quǎn\"), Chinese Chongqing Dog, Xiasi Dog, and several other native dog breeds distributed across China.\nPage: Huayuan Area. Sentence: Huayuan (华苑小区) is a town of Nankai District, Tianjin, China, which has a population of 70,000.",
